+# CONTRACT — Multi-tenant Analytics Dashboard API
+
+## Infrastructure
+- [ ] `createApp(db?)` exported from `src/app.ts` and re-exported from `src/index.ts` → returns Express app
+- [ ] DB initialized from `schema.sql` → tables exist
+- [ ] `npm run build` passes (tsc strict)
+- [ ] `npm run lint` passes (eslint)
+
+## Auth / User Management
+- [ ] POST /api/auth/register {email,password,tenantId,role?} → 201 {token,user}
+- [ ] Duplicate email → 409
+- [ ] Missing fields → 400
+- [ ] POST /api/auth/login {email,password} → 200 {token,user}; bad creds → 401
+- [ ] GET /api/me with token → 200 profile (no password_hash); no token → 401
+- [ ] PATCH /api/users/:id/role {role} as admin same tenant → 200; non-admin → 403; other tenant target → 404; invalid role → 400
+- [ ] GET /api/users (admin) lists tenant users only
+
+## Ingestion (auth required)
+- [ ] POST /api/events {name,properties?,timestamp?} → 201 {event}; tenant auto-set
+- [ ] Missing name → 400
+- [ ] POST /api/events/batch {events:[...]} → 201 {count}; non-array/empty → 400
+- [ ] No token → 401
+
+## Query Engine (auth required, tenant-isolated)
+- [ ] POST /api/query/count {name?,filters?,from?,to?} → {count}
+- [ ] POST /api/query/timeseries {name?,interval,from?,to?} → {buckets:[{bucket,count}]}
+- [ ] POST /api/query/breakdown {property,name?} → {breakdown:[{value,count}]}
+- [ ] Queries only return calling tenant's events (isolation verified by test)
+
+## Dashboards (auth required, tenant-scoped)
+- [ ] POST /api/dashboards {name,config?} → 201
+- [ ] GET /api/dashboards → list tenant dashboards
+- [ ] GET /api/dashboards/:id → 200 own tenant; 404 other tenant
+- [ ] PUT /api/dashboards/:id → 200 update
+- [ ] DELETE /api/dashboards/:id → 204
+- [ ] No token → 401
+
+## Export (auth required, tenant-bounded)
+- [ ] GET /api/export/events?format=json → JSON array of tenant events
+- [ ] GET /api/export/events?format=csv → text/csv with header row
+- [ ] GET /api/export/dashboards/:id?format=json|csv → dashboard export, tenant-bounded
+- [ ] No token → 401
